{
  "about": "The grow timing pass (CARD-GROW.md §19): the rows come in at 0.4 of the open, the collapse runs over 0.24 s, the covered card fades back in its own cell (no 'Library' pill at the bottom left). Midi and Max, every skin.",
  "desk_test": "cards/CARD-GROW.md §19.1, steps 1–3",
  "made": "2026-10-01",
  "pass": "Each open strip shows rows before the edge stops; no frame shows an empty, still card. Each collapse strip shows the covered card fading in its own place; no small pill at the bottom left. The probes read the state the step should leave (grown, then null). The old-order shot (grow-old) is the A/B baseline: the first row shows later there.",
  "run": "node scripts/shots.mjs --list docs/ops/checks/grow-timing.json  → shots/grow-timing/<version>/",
  "looks": [{ "theme": "moonlight", "skin": "*" }],
  "shots": [
    {
      "id": "midi-grow",
      "about": "Midi: the left card grows over the right one from its edge bar, then Escape collapses it.",
      "covers": "cards/CARD-GROW.md",
      "kind": "clip", "source": "demo", "size": "midi", "seconds": 3.5,
      "steps": [
        { "hover": "[data-slot=\"left\"] .grow-zone[data-side=\"right\"]" },
        { "wait": 300 },
        { "click": "[data-slot=\"left\"] .grow-zone[data-side=\"right\"]", "frames": 36 },
        { "wait": 1200 },
        { "probe": "JSON.stringify(__grow.state?.() ?? null)" },
        { "key": "Escape", "frames": 30 },
        { "wait": 900 },
        { "probe": "JSON.stringify(__grow.state?.() ?? null)" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "midi-grow-old",
      "about": "The same with --grow-rows-at = 1 (the old order: rows at the end of the open). The baseline for midi-grow.",
      "covers": "cards/CARD-GROW.md",
      "kind": "clip", "source": "demo", "size": "midi", "seconds": 3.5,
      "steps": [
        { "eval": "document.documentElement.style.setProperty('--grow-rows-at','1')" },
        { "hover": "[data-slot=\"left\"] .grow-zone[data-side=\"right\"]" },
        { "wait": 300 },
        { "click": "[data-slot=\"left\"] .grow-zone[data-side=\"right\"]", "frames": 36 },
        { "wait": 1200 },
        { "key": "Escape", "frames": 30 },
        { "wait": 900 }
      ]
    },
    {
